# The premise is ASSERTED, not derived: the seat injects call_purpose(calla,
# alter) for a write, so a premise naming Inspect (call_purpose(calla, inspect))
# is false and the evaluator refuses before any rule is queried.
CallA serves Inspect.
CallA is grounded in a verb W1 if CallA is named W1.
CallA contends for a verb W1 if CallA is grounded in W1.
